[28.541, "o", "_Imported from Conductor by `conch import conductor`._\r\n\r\n# Handoff: Tests for the coupon validator\r\n\r\nConversation from a Codex session (`0199f1c2-9e44-7f02-8a6b-1c3d5e7f9a02`) in `~/conductor/workspaces/storefront/lisbon` on branch `ada/coupon-codes`, 2026-11-02 11:20 – 2026-11-02 11:41.\r\n\r\nOnly the messages are included: tool calls, command output and file edits are left out, so check the files themselves for the current state.\r\n\r\n## User · 2026-11-02 11:20:00\r\n\r\nWrite tests for applyCoupon in app/checkout/coupon.ts: expired, used up, unknown code, percentage, fixed amount bigger than the cart.\r\n\r\n## Codex · 2026-11-02 11:22:00\r\n\r\nAdded app/checkout/coupon.test.ts with 9 cases. All pass except one: a code is matched case-sensitively, so `SPRING10` and `spring10` differ. Should codes be case-insensitive?\r\n\r\n## User · 2026-11-02 11:24:00\r\n\r\nYes, case-insensitive. Normalise to upper case when storing.\r\n\r\n## Codex · 2026-11-02 11:26:0"]
[28.541, "o", "0\r\n\r\nCodes are upper-cased on insert and on lookup; the migration upper-cases existing rows. 10 tests, all passing.\r\n"]
